/**
@mainpage FinEleMethod C++ API

FinEleMethod is a from-scratch finite element solver with a reusable C++20
engine, a command-line application, and a Windows workbench.

@section api_layers Architecture

- `finelemethod::model` stores nodes, elements, materials, and loads.
- `finelemethod::element` evaluates Q4 and H8 element formulations.
- `finelemethod::assembly` constructs global systems through COO and CSR data.
- `finelemethod::solver` applies constraints and solves linear static systems.
- `finelemethod::analysis` coordinates complete analysis workflows.
- `finelemethod::output` writes results and analysis metadata.
- `finelemethod::cli` exposes the solver engine without the GUI.

The public headers under `include/finelemethod` are the primary API reference.
*/
